   "city": "DiamondCityWorld"
  },
  "summary": "<p>Two pilots on 1 October, two runs in each condition: BBAA flew the single drone first, BBCC the swarm. The city was DiamondCityWorld, the tile city laid out eight by eight with its rows staggered and four diamond-shaped parks, each a superblock of four tiles. Practice was flown separately and not recorded, so every run here counts. The pilot pressed the RC's button at each identify; the outcomes were not keyed.</p>",
  "changes_title": "Changes since internal_2",
  "changes": [
   {
    "area": "City",
    "items": [
     "<b>DiamondCityWorld replaces ScaledCityWorld:</b> an eight-by-eight grid of tiles with staggered rows and four diamond parks of four tiles each (<span class=\"code\">88aa94e7</span>, <span class=\"code\">fe38e13a</span>, <span class=\"code\">57559907</span>), the spawn road twice as long (<span class=\"code\">9490e308</span>).",
     "<b>Verge trees on every goal patch</b> (<span class=\"code\">2d2ce82c</span>)."
    ],
    "leads": [
     "DiamondCityWorld replaces ScaledCityWorld",
     "Verge trees on every goal patch"
    ]
   },
   {
    "area": "Swarm",
    "items": [
     "<b>The fix for internal_2's collisions at the tightest spread:</b> the hollow core now matches velocity relative to the swarm instead of braking every ring drone, and a close-range damper opposes two drones closing on each other (<span class=\"code\">fe3a448b</span>)."
    ],
    "leads": [
     "The fix for internal_2's collisions at the tightest spread"
